{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to face an unrelenting onslaught of savage creatures in this adrenaline-fueled 2D top-down arcade-shooter where every second is a fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only hope is to master a vast and devastating arsenal of weapons, from blistering-fast machine guns to screen-clearing explosives, as you carve a path of destruction across the 8 intricately detailed maps the world has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is more than just a battle; it's a journey of growth. You'll level up your survivor through a deep and unique class and perk system, fine-tuning your abilities to become the ultimate monster-slaying force and constantly shattering your previous high scores as your power grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't have to face the nightmare alone; endure the peril as a solitary hero, or form a squad with up to 3 other friends and watch each other's backs in a glorious symphony of cooperative chaos</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Survivor Novice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3886690/09db768e951bbcbacb49c82162085ba7cf90df9d.jpg"},{"name":"Swift Executioner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3886690/f1f501f63e620b197a6e2761723b2e10abfadb55.jpg"},{"name":"Survival Marathon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3886690/5696d38f6bd8605ab1ac384fc3ea9f1471ff514c.jpg"},{"name":"Coin Connoisseur","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3886690/cc8b4748d64d5b7a0423ce801e390d629c8bbe49.jpg"},{"name":"Novice Loot Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3886690/1e25cb42031139e12b0876bc0d880b5ea713a941.jpg"},{"name":"One with the Shadows","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3886690/dcda9a1632ae4cdfe9b5458dc48459a21982c371.j